=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088640/extras/3b940e9fb16d4331f22d82033cc13c53.poster.avif?t=1760685859\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088640/extras/3b940e9fb16d4331f22d82033cc13c53.webm?t=1760685859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088640/extras/3b940e9fb16d4331f22d82033cc13c53.mp4?t=1760685859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Match a donor for the married couple</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the donor in your database who most closely matches the client.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088640/extras/e22acf7f350699275108e029930a44ef.poster.avif?t=1760685859\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088640/extras/e22acf7f350699275108e029930a44ef.webm?t=1760685859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088640/extras/e22acf7f350699275108e029930a44ef.mp4?t=1760685859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become a successful reproductive specialist</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more the child from donor biomaterial resembles the parents, the more effective you will be as a reproductive specialist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088640/extras/9cf0d69ca44a05369bd338e0c547ab04.poster.avif?t=1760685859\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.s